as sales agent and will use commercially reasonable efforts to sell on our behalf all of the shares of common stock requested to be sold
by us, consistent with its normal trading and sales practices. As of June 12 2023, we have sold 25,538,424 shares of our common stock
with an aggregate offering price of approximately $20.3 million, leaving an aggregate offering price of up to approximately $7.1 million
remaining under the Equity Distribution Agreement.. See &ldquo;Plan of Distribution.&rdquo;</TD></TR>
