    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify">Includes (i) 1,510,568 shares of common stock included in the Purchaser Shares, and (ii) 2,101,769 shares of common stock included in the Earnout Shares issuable upon the receipt of stockholder approval, in accordance with and as required by the Nasdaq Listing Rules.</TD></TR>
