    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify; width: 0.25in">&#9679;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">ordinary brokerage transactions and transactions in which the broker-dealer solicits purchasers;</TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

